<title>BRAZIL: Brazil December 3-week exports $2.843 bln.</title>
<headline>Brazil December 3-week exports $2.843 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian exports for the first three weeks of December totalled $2.843 billion, or an average of $189.5 million a day, a spokesman for the Ministry of Industry and Commerce said.</p>
<p>Exports for the five working days of the third week of the month totalled $1.026 billion, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>Brazil's November exports were $3.912 billion.</p>
<p>((-- Julio Villaverde, Brasilia Newsroom 5561 322 6962))</p>
